LanguageServer -- language server
*********************************

Description
===========

This package provides a language server for Macaulay2 implementing the Language
Server Protocol (LSP) (see
https://microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/ ). It is used via the
M2-language-server script, which is distributed with Macaulay2 and starts the
server with standard input and output as the communication channel.

The language server is supported out of the box by the following editors:

  * the Macaulay2 major mode for Emacs (see
    https://github.com/Macaulay2/M2-emacs ), using eglot or lsp-mode
  * the Macaulay2 extension for VS Code (see
    https://github.com/Macaulay2/vscode-macaulay2 )
  * the Macaulay2 plugin for Neovim (see
    https://github.com/Macaulean/macaulay2.nvim )
* Menu:

* LSPServer::                   LSP server class

