LSPServer -- LSP server class
*****************************

  * Usage: 
        new LSPServer

Description
===========

LSPServer is the main class of the package.  It wraps a JSON-RPC server and
handles the LSP lifecycle: initialize, text document synchronization, and
shutdown.

+---------------------------+
|i1 : server = new LSPServer|
|                           |
|o1 = server                |
|                           |
|o1 : LSPServer             |
+---------------------------+
* Menu:

* start::                       start the language server
* setLogger(LSPServer,Function): (JSONRPC)setLogger_lpLSPServer_cmFunction_rp.

Methods that use a LSP server:
==============================

  * "new LSPServer"
  * *note setLogger(LSPServer,Function): setLogger_lpLSPServer_cmFunction_rp,
    -- set up logging for an LSP server
  * "start(LSPServer)" -- see *note start: start, -- start the language server

