start -- start the language server
**********************************

  * Usage: 
        start server
  * Inputs:
      * server, a *note LSP server: LSPServer,, 

Description
===========

Starts the language server, reading LSP messages from *note stdio:
(Macaulay2Doc)stdio, and writing responses back to *note stdio:
(Macaulay2Doc)stdio,.  This is called automatically by the M2-language-server
script and is not typically invoked directly by the user.

Ways to use start:
==================

  * "start(LSPServer)"

